      "question": "Online process btaiye KGMU opd ka",
      "answer": "KGMU OPD ke liye online appointment process yeh hai:\n\n1.  **Website par jayein:** www.ors.gov.in\n2.  **Login karein:** Agar aapka pehle se account hai toh login karein, warna naya account banayein.\n3.  **Hospital/Department choose karein:** KGMU (King George's Medical University) ko hospital ke taur par aur phir psychiatry department ko choose karein.\n4.  **Doctor aur time select karein:** Aap available doctors aur unke appointment slots dekh sakte hain.\n5.  **Appointment confirm karein:** Apni details fill karke appointment confirm karein.\n\nAapko appointment ki confirm karne ke liye ek SMS ya portal par confirmation milega.",
