    {
      "id": "qa_1771236083785_3d8rjg47",
      "question": "Online patient ka discharge status kaise check karein",
      "answer": "Maaf kijiye, main aapko kisi bhi mareez ki niji ya medical jaankari nahi de sakta hoon, ismein discharge status bhi shaamil hai. Yeh sabhi jaankariyon ki goopniyata (privacy) ke liye zaroori hai.\n\nAgar aap kisi mareez ke discharge status ke baare mein jaanna chahte hain, toh aapko yeh karna chahiye:\n\n1.  **Hospital se seedhe sampark karein:** Sabse accha tareeka yeh hai ki aap hospital ke ward ya administrative office mein phone karke poochhein.\n2.  **Mareez ke ilaaj karne wale doctor ya nurse se baat karein:** Unke paas mareez ki vartamaan sthiti aur unke discharge ke baare mein sabse sahi aur taaza jaankari hogi.\n\nMain ek AI assistant hoon aur kisi bhi niji ya medical data tak meri pahunch nahi hai.",
